%% title: Authentication and session admission sequence
%% last_updated: 2026-07-28
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant Auth as NextAuth route
    participant Provider as OAuth / Passkey
    participant DB as Azure SQL

    User->>Browser: Choose provider or passkey
    Browser->>Auth: Start sign-in
    Auth->>Provider: Verify provider claim / credential
    Provider-->>Auth: Verified identity
    Auth->>DB: Create or load User
    Auth->>DB: Lock User and count ACTIVE sessions
    alt Fewer than five active sessions
        Auth->>DB: Create ACTIVE LoginSession
        Auth-->>Browser: Signed JWT session cookie
    else Session limit reached
        Auth->>DB: Create short-lived PENDING LoginSession
        Auth-->>Browser: Session-selection required
        Browser->>Auth: Select sessions to keep
        Auth->>DB: Revoke others and activate pending session
        Auth-->>Browser: Active session
    end
